{"schema":1,"locale":"zh-Hans","created_at":"2026-11-28T14:19:36.878Z","entries":{"docs-7.24\u0000## routing/rip/instance **Type:** Directory":"## routing/rip/instance \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/rip/interface-template **Type:** Directory":"## routing/rip/interface-template \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/rip/keys **Type:** Directory":"## routing/rip/keys \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/rip/neighbor **Type:** Directory":"## routing/rip/neighbor \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/rip/static-neighbor **Type:** Directory":"## routing/rip/static-neighbor \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/route **Type:** Directory":"## routing/route \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/rpki **Type:** Directory":"## routing/rpki \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/rpki/rpki-check **Type:** Command":"## routing/rpki/rpki-check \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/rpki/rpki-query **Type:** Command":"## routing/rpki/rpki-query \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/rpki/session **Type:** Directory":"## routing/rpki/session \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/rule **Type:** Directory":"## routing/rule\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/settings **Type:** Settings Directory":"## routing/settings \n**类型：** 设置目录","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/stats/memory **Type:** Directory":"## routing/stats/memory \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## routing/stats/origin **Type:** Directory":"## routing/stats/origin \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000A read-only table that lists routes from all the address families as well as all filtered routes with all possible route attributes.":"该只读表列出来自所有地址族的路由，以及所有带有全部可能路由属性的已过滤路由。","docs-7.24\u0000Default example output of the table with various route types:":"包含多种路由类型的表默认输出示例：","docs-7.24\u0000Detailed example output with some BGP, OSPF, and other routes:":"包含部分 BGP、OSPF 和其他路由的详细输出示例：","docs-7.24\u0000MD5 authentication key chains.":"MD5 认证密钥链。","docs-7.24\u0000The maximum metric of a RIP route is 15. A metric higher than 15 is considered 'infinity' and routes with such a metric are considered unreachable. Thus RIP cannot be used on networks with more than 15 hops between any two routers, and using redistribute metrics larger than 1 further reduces this maximum hop count.":"RIP 路由的最大 metric 为 15。大于 15 的 metric 被视为“infinity”，具有该 metric 的路由被视为不可达。因此，RIP 不能用于任意两台路由器之间超过 15 跳的网络，使用大于 1 的 redistribute metric 会进一步减少该最大跳数。","docs-7.24\u0000This submenu is used to define neighboring routers to exchange routing information with. Normally there is no need to add the neighbors, if multicasting is working properly within the network. If there are problems with exchanging routing information, neighbor routers can be added to the list. It will force the router to exchange the routing information with the neighbor using regular unicast packets.":"此子菜单用于定义要与其交换路由信息的相邻路由器。通常，如果网络内组播正常工作，则无需添加邻居。如果交换路由信息出现问题，可以将相邻路由器添加到列表中。这将强制路由器使用普通单播数据包与邻居交换路由信息。"}}
